Author: JimmyShi22 <417711026@qq.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 14 06:26:29 2026 +0800

    Bind the trusted table set in verification and keep the version gate
    
    The verifier now rebuilds the anchor with the trusted encoded-table list of
    the selected model, so a version-two gpt2 commitment is checked against its
    published table leaves instead of rejecting the extra anchor leaf. The
    context loader reads the published table metas, binds them to the same trusted
    list, and runs the model-version gate before the anchor rebuild, so an
    old-version artifact keeps the existing rejection semantics while the
    historical artifacts stay on disk. gemma3 and timesfm keep an empty table
    list.
    
    This is the verifier wiring only; the policy registration and the consumer
    relation are the next step.

